  "description": "Dear team,\n\nThe Tetris Widget (ID: widget/12345) is now published (status: published) with an entity tag of abc123-def. It was originally created at 1700000000000 by the component identified by curie\u202facme:iam:node:widget-creator, id\u202fcreator-001, tag\u202fcreatorTag. The latest update occurred at 1700000500000 by the updater\u202facme:iam:node:widget-updater (id\u202fupdater-007, tag\u202fupdaterTag), and the most recent event recorded is\u202facme:blog:event:widget-updated (id\u202fevent-20230615, tag\u202feventTag).\n\nThe widget\u2019s title is \u201cTetris Widget\u201d. Before rendering, it injects the HTML `<div class=\"pre\">Pre-render HTML</div>` and after rendering it adds `<div class=\"post\">Post-render HTML</div>`. Both the border and header are enabled, with the header displaying the text \u201cPlay Tetris\u201d. The layout used is the \u201cstandard\u2011layout\u201d template.\n\nExternal references include a partner link at https://partner.example.com labeled \u201cPartner Site\u201d, and a \u201cView All Games\u201d link at https://example.com/view-all with the text \u201cView All Games\u201d."
